      hu: ["Nakuru 2021-ben kapta meg hivatalosan a 'city' rangot.", "A közeli Menengai-kráter pereme 2490 méter magasan van.", "A Nakuru-tó Nemzeti Parkot 1961-ben hozták létre.", "A város tengerszint feletti magassága kb. 1850 méter.", "A Hyrax Hill egy fontos újkőkori régészeti lelőhely.", "A várost Kenya mezőgazdasági központjaként ismerik."],
      ro: ["Nakuru a primit oficial statutul de 'city' în anul 2021.", "Craterul Menengai are o altitudine de circa 2.490 metri.", "Parcul Național Lacul Nakuru a fost înființat în 1961.", "Orașul este situat la o altitudine de aproximativ 1.850 metri.", "Hyrax Hill este un sit arheologic neolitic de importanță majoră.", "Nakuru este considerat inima agricolă a Kenyei."],
      en: ["Nakuru was officially elevated to city status in 2021.", "The nearby Menengai Crater rises to 2,490 meters.", "Lake Nakuru National Park was established in 1961.", "The city sits at an elevation of approximately 1,850 meters.", "Hyrax Hill is a key Neolithic archaeological site nearby.", "Nakuru is widely regarded as the agricultural capital of Kenya."],
