      en: ["Founded in the 14th century, the oldest Swahili town.", "Designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2001.", "Vehicle-free town with over 3,000 donkeys for transport.", "Architecture features coral stone and mangrove timber.", "Host of the Maulidi festival since the 19th century.", "Site of the major LAPSSET deep-water port project."],
      es: [],
