      en: ["Kajiado is situated at an elevation of approximately 1,732 meters.", "The town is located about 80 kilometers south of Kenya’s capital, Nairobi.", "The Magadi soda ash factory in the region was established in 1911.", "Amboseli National Park in Kajiado County covers 392 square kilometers.", "The area receives an average annual rainfall of approximately 500 mm.", "Kajiado is officially part of the Nairobi Metropolitan Region."],
