      en: ["Busia is part of the Northern Corridor, 450 km from Mombasa by road.", "More than 500 trucks pass through the Busia border crossing every day.", "The town sits at an elevation of approximately 1,200 meters.", "Average annual rainfall in Busia ranges from 1,270 mm to 1,790 mm.", "The total area of Busia County is approximately 1,694 square km.", "The Luhya and Iteso are the primary ethnic communities in the town."],
