      en: ["Voi is situated approximately 160 kilometers inland from Mombasa.", "Tsavo East National Park was officially established in 1948.", "The highest peak in the nearby Taita Hills reaches 2,208 meters.", "The Voi railway station was originally built in 1897 during construction.", "The annual average rainfall in Voi is approximately 600 mm.", "The modern SGR railway station in Voi was opened to the public in 2017."],
