      en: ["Mumias served as the capital of the Wanga Kingdom, Kenya's only pre-colonial centralized state.", "The town is situated at an elevation of approximately 1,312 meters above sea level.", "Nabongo Mumia ruled the region from 1882 until his death in 1949.", "The Mumias Sugar Company was established in 1971 as a government-led project.", "It is located along the major highway connecting the city of Kisumu to the border town of Busia.", "The Nabongo Cultural Centre preserves the artifacts and history of the Wanga people."],
