      en: ["Nanyuki was founded in 1907 by British settlers as a supply post.", "The town is situated on the Equator at an altitude of 1,947 meters.", "It serves as the main base for expeditions to Mount Kenya's peaks.", "The Laikipia Air Base, a major Kenyan military facility, is located here.", "The British Army Training Unit Kenya (BATUK) is headquartered in Nanyuki.", "Nearby Ol Pejeta Conservancy is home to the world's last northern white rhinos."],
